                    <p>NextGen Innovators is a school-level entrepreneurship initiative by E-Cell GCOE Kolhapur,
                        designed to plant the seeds of entrepreneurial thinking in young minds.</p>
                    <p>We believe that the greatest ideas are born when students learn to see problems as opportunities
                        — and are given the tools, mentorship, and platform to act on them.</p>
                    <div class="mission-pillars">
                        <div class="pillar">
                            <div class="pillar-num">I</div>
                            <div class="pillar-body">
                                <h4>Identify &amp; Innovate</h4>
                                <p>Train students to spot real-world problems and ideate breakthrough solutions using
                                    design thinking principles.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="pillar">
                            <div class="pillar-num">II</div>
