                        <div class="timeline-desc">The grand launch — students form cross-grade innovation squads,
                            ignite their entrepreneurial mindset, and receive a real-world problem statement.</div>
                        <div class="timeline-tags"><span class="tag">Mindset Activation</span><span class="tag">Team
                                Formation</span><span class="tag">Challenge Brief</span></div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="timeline-item fade-in">
                    <div class="timeline-node">2</div>
                    <div class="timeline-content">
                        <div class="timeline-phase">Phase 1 · Event 2</div>
                        <div class="timeline-name"><i class="ri-smartphone-line"></i> Social Media Challenge</div>
                        <div class="timeline-date"><i class="ri-calendar-line"></i> Ongoing — Phase 1</div>
                        <div class="timeline-desc">Teams build the school E-Cell's digital presence through creative
