                        <div class="timeline-name"><i class="ri-building-line"></i> Startup 101 Workshop</div>
                        <div class="timeline-date"><i class="ri-calendar-line"></i> 15th – 31st August</div>
                        <div class="timeline-desc">A full-day deep dive into entrepreneurship. Students learn to
                            identify market gaps, brainstorm viable solutions, build resilience, and complete a one-page
                            business model.</div>
                        <div class="timeline-tags"><span class="tag">Problem Solving</span><span class="tag">Business
