                            performers earn a coveted invitation to the grand Idea Ignite Junior stage at E-Summit GCOE
                            Kolhapur.</div>
                        <div class="timeline-tags"><span class="tag">Presentations</span><span class="tag">Top 5
                                Qualify</span><span class="tag">E-Summit Entry</span></div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="timeline-item fade-in">
                    <div class="timeline-node">5</div>
                    <div class="timeline-content">
                        <div class="timeline-phase">Phase 3 · Event 0</div>
                        <div class="timeline-name"><i class="ri-bank-line"></i> Field Visit at E-Cell GCOEK</div>
                        <div class="timeline-date"><i class="ri-calendar-line"></i> Diwali Vacation</div>
                        <div class="timeline-desc">A free-of-cost field visit to E-Cell GCOE Kolhapur — students
