                    <div class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                        <span class="faq-question-text">Can a school have more than one registration?</span>
                        <span class="faq-toggle"><i class="ri-add-line"></i></span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        <div class="faq-answer-inner">No. Each participating school may register only one official team
                            for NextGen Innovators 2026.</div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="faq-item">
                    <div class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                        <span class="faq-question-text">Is there any registration fee?</span>
                        <span class="faq-toggle"><i class="ri-add-line"></i></span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        <div class="faq-answer-inner">No. Registration for NextGen Innovators is completely free of cost
                            for all participating schools and students.</div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="faq-item">
                    <div class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                        <span class="faq-question-text">I am a student and want this program to run in my school. What
                            should I do?</span>
                        <span class="faq-toggle"><i class="ri-add-line"></i></span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        <div class="faq-answer-inner">Contact your teacher, ask for their permission and register as a
                            student referring the name of the teacher who can lead NextGen Innovators in your school.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="faq-item">
                    <div class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                        <span class="faq-question-text">What are the prerequisites?</span>
                        <span class="faq-toggle"><i class="ri-add-line"></i></span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        <div class="faq-answer-inner">There are no prerequisites — anyone can participate. All you need
                            is curiosity and a desire to innovate.</div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="faq-item">
                    <div class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                        <span class="faq-question-text">Who can participate?</span>
                        <span class="faq-toggle"><i class="ri-add-line"></i></span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        <div class="faq-answer-inner">Any school can participate in our program. There are no
                            restrictions on school board, location, or size.</div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="faq-item">
                    <div class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                        <span class="faq-question-text">I want to participate in NextGen Innovators. What steps do I
                            follow?</span>
                        <span class="faq-toggle"><i class="ri-add-line"></i></span>
